																"en_US": "NPM provides managers and supervisors with the visibility and insights related to all data (interaction, transactional, operational, behavioral, personalized per employee, and many others), so that they can coach and guide employees to achieve their best performance.<br>\n<br>\nNPM drives employee engagement by focusing on the right coaching, gamification elements,&nbsp;and learning activities that benefit employees and make their roles more rewarding.<br>\n<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.nice.com/products/workforce-engagement/performance-management\" target=\"_blank\">Learn More</a><br>\n<strong>Download:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.nice.com/-/media/niceincontact/resources/white-papers/import/npm_ebook.ashx?rev=9a29b20075d846deba793e45218e93f4%20%20https://www.nice.com/-/media/niceincontact/resources/datasheets/2022/03/wcx-npm-enlighten-npm-integration-br.ashx?rev=dad851646fbe44c8b0b745a68cafe8b1\" target=\"_blank\">NPM eBook</a></strong><br>\n<strong>Download:&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.nice.com/resources/npm-coaching-brochure\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>NPM Coaching Brochure</strong></a>"
															}
														}
													}
												}
											],
											"indexed": true
										},
										"type": "Fragment"
